## Command

```shell
biome format --attribute-position multiline --write file.js
```

## `file.js`

```js
<Foo
	className={style}
	reallyLongAttributeName1={longComplexValue}
	reallyLongAttributeName2={anotherLongValue}
/>;

<Foo
	reallyLongAttributeName1={longComplexValue}
	reallyLongAttributeName2={anotherLongValue}
>
	Hi
</Foo>;

```

